name: ['Ancestral Recall', 'Arvad, Weatherlight Smuggler', 'Benalish Knight-Counselor', 'Black Lotus', 'Bloodsprout Talisman', 'Coalition Construct', "Darigaaz's Whelp", 'Darigaaz, Shivan Champion', 'Diminished Returner', 'Ghitu Embercoiler', 'Goblin Influx Array', 'Goblin Morale Sergeant', 'Juggernaut Peddler', "Marwyn's Kindred", 'Mox Emerald', 'Mox Jet', 'Mox Pearl', 'Mox Ruby', 'Mox Sapphire', 'Nantuko Slicer', 'Niambi, Beloved Protector', 'Oracle of the Alpha', 'Priest of Possibility', 'Protean War Engine', 'Pull of the Mist Moon', 'Reezug, the Bonecobbler', 'Skywriter Djinn', 'Slimefoot, Thallid Transplant', 'Smogbelcher Chariot', 'Spellchain Scatter', "Teferi's Contingency", 'Tiana, Angelic Mechanic', 'Time Walk', 'Timetwister', 'Trove Mage', 'Vesuvan Mist', 'Vinesoul Spider', 'Vodalian Tide Mage', 'Wandering Treefolk']
